# The #5239 mechanism: enforcement judges the envelope, so a valid body is diverted.
MODULE: DeadLettersOnlyRefusedJudgesEnvelope
TARGET: DeadLettersOnlyRefused
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: every enveloped entry is dead-lettered
PERTURBS: Judge

--- FIND
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], seen) THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- REPLACE
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], seen) \/ val[cur].form = "Env" THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- END